                    <msContents><summary/>
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                            <locus from="1v"/>
                            <title>Register by the Council of the Vilayet of Tripoli</title>
                            <note>A certified copy of a register drawn up by the Council of the Vilayet of <placeName ref="https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3579">Tripoli</placeName>,
                                dated <date when-custom="1282-10-23" calendar="hijri" when="1866-03-02">23 Shawwal 1282 H. (= March 2, 1866 A.D.)</date>,
                                concerning sales carried out with the approval of the Sublime Porte since 
                                <date when-custom="1277" calendar="hijri" when="1861">1277 H. (= 1861 A.D.)</date>. 
                                The copy was made on 
                                <date when-custom="1318-11-27" calendar="hijri" when="1901-03-18">27 Ḏū l-Qaʿdah 1318 H. (= March 18, 1901 A.D.)</date>. 
                                The register is signed by the Wāli of Tripoli, <persName ref="https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1176678">Mahmud Nedim Pasha</persName>, and by other
                                members of the Council, including the Mufti, the Turkish and Arabic secretaries, and the second rabbi, who represented the Jewish
                                community. The lands in question are those of ‘Katis’ (or ‘Katisi’), ‘Wadi al-Hire’ (or ‘Hyre’), and ‘Wadi al-Etel’, located between
                                <placeName ref="https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q312307">al-ʿAzīzīyah</placeName> and <placeName ref="https://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q867102">Ġaryān</placeName>.</note>
                            <textLang xml:lang="tu"/>
                            <incipit xml:lang="tu" type="inscriptio">Trablusgarp vilayetinde kâin olup ba iradei seniye yetmis yedi senesindenberi fruht olunarak
                                Katis, ve Vadi-el-Hire ve Vadi-el-Etel arazisiyle emlak muccelatĭ vakĭanĭnĭ mikdarĭnĭ mubeyyin muhasebei vilayetten tanzim olunam 
                                mazbatali defterdir.</incipit>
                        </msItem>
                    </msContents>
